  "docs/6.x/index.html_722ac39fa10d_part0": "}",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_12df41407d2c_part0": ")",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_b2dabfe72c8a_part0": "复制",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_67dcda3f59ac_part0": "该元素应包含",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_06de597941d2_part0": "position:relative",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_b21876ed6e18_part0": "通过 CSS 设置该样式。",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_644db8c3592a_part0": "类型",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_d0472eea05d9_part0": "如果您在使用 jsPlumb 的连接或端点时遇到定位问题，请检查您是否已",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_d42e2d0c0e95_part0": "position:relative",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_ad94a39ae3b3_part0": "设置在您的容器上。jsPlumb 使用绝对定位，浏览器会根据其第一个设置了相对定位的祖先元素来计算该定位。",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_a66291773347_part0": "元素注册",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_12b08159c9d7_part0": "jsPlumb 会跟踪一组“受管理”的元素，大多数情况下这一过程是透明的，但在某些情况下需要用户干预。当你调用",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_efd65bfedb1a_part0": "addEndpoint",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_0724637adf80_part0": "在某个元素上，该元素会自动添加到托管列表中：",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_e9b4b3f144aa_part0": "实例",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_dcce256483ea_part0": ".",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_37b1cdc10dd5_part0": "addEndpoint",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_4d6efe8ba875_part0": "someElement",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_5606a902616d_part0": ",",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_3f52111f9751_part0": "端点",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_ab78bbd94cbd_part0": ":",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_491459df44f9_part0": "'Dot'",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_8bef91f1165a_part0": "}",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_a435cf927f63_part0": ")",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_8fb9a548a37e_part0": "复制",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_5a39094f9dc1_part0": "在内部，jsPlumb 会为",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_3f38ac48fa02_part0": "someElement",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_c8d4f530c0b0_part0": "，并将其作为该元素的",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_cbb4b2505e6a_part0": "data-jtk-managed",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_2e444d00f282_part0": "属性：",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_413b8d70b3f4_part0": "<",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_009fbd592e92_part0": "二",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_055d2469e3e9_part0": "data-jtk-managed",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_ee883b78fe36_part0": "=",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_bc76bff04768_part0": "\"",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_f157e9fec8ce_part0": "7897-42342-4234-4234",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_b4341e4a10be_part0": "\"",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_8487d6458afa_part0": ">",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_46cbcb837a9a_part0": "该元素的内容",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_a4d7910f0bce_part0": "</",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_b3b907364283_part0": "二",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_371c52c78b7b_part0": ">",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_4830c2559b17_part0": "复制",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_1331bc8752ec_part0": "该要素的存在",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_8e3d715f537d_part0": "data-jtk-managed",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_df29f0b951d1_part0": "该元素使 jsPlumb 能够为其启用拖拽功能，并处理将其拖入或拖出组时发生的情况。",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_c8c07bfadb63_part0": "同样地，当你调用",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_5d69d953e7fe_part0": "连接",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_e2b8b06a5a3f_part0": "如果包含一个或多个元素，则这些元素将被添加到托管列表中：",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_eca129825b42_part0": "实例",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_7c4e8d565ea1_part0": ".",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_a8a9b5a9e371_part0": "连接",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_02a1f3b9d1b6_part0": "来源",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_b93f8591e296_part0": ":",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_a22f22ce6e4a_part0": "someElement",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_fed43bbfc393_part0": ",",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_8d0aacb66183_part0": "目标",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_f7efdfcd706d_part0": ":",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_e7e37c7681be_part0": "someOtherElement",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_9afdb9fa4e90_part0": "}",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_9d0721822339_part0": ")",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_51de448c07a2_part0": "复制",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_141fb147b4ed_part0": "手动注册元素",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_cd932563a8a2_part0": "有时，您可能希望在尚未为某个元素配置任何端点，或将其作为参数传递给一个",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_b82d2b9ec650_part0": "连接",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_e577a3b17aff_part0": "调用。事实上，这种情况并不罕见，就像当你使用",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_504f0cc8eb52_part0": "addSourceSelector",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_694b653f2563_part0": "在用户界面中配置拖放连接的方法，您很可能不会再为各个元素单独添加端点。为方便操作，jsPlumb 提供了该方法",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_2a12278e7060_part0": "管理",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_e38c762d7824_part0": ":",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_0da9c4427246_part0": "实例",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_ab68ee7f1045_part0": ".",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_34fff651c097_part0": "管理",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_7c252c79fa95_part0": "someElement",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_327d41b3832d_part0": ")",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_74928c68219e_part0": "复制",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_0fb860826ce4_part0": "管理",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_13706823bf6e_part0": "还支持第二个参数，允许您指定 jsPlumb 应使用的内部 ID：",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_93316c88f0f4_part0": "实例",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_d70dc2819537_part0": ".",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_89af4c8d7054_part0": "管理",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_8b3251426586_part0": "someElement",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_7e6cdf17ad18_part0": ",",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_c724f6eab19e_part0": "“要使用的 ID”",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_4348fa6408d6_part0": ")",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_f5b5d964f071_part0": "复制",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_9312b0bf8f40_part0": "注意",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_538dd785ce91_part0": "您有责任确保所请求的内部 ID 在整个数据集中是唯一的。如果分配了重复的内部 ID，将会得到非确定性的结果。",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_2787710e0f3c_part0": "关于 Z-index 的注意事项",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_781283e8858e_part0": "在使用 jsPlumb 时，您需要注意 UI 各部分的 z-index 值，特别是要确保 jsPlumb 添加到 DOM 中的元素不会覆盖界面的其他部分。",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_d1760fd3bab0_part0": "jsPlumb 会为每个端点、连接器和叠加层在 DOM 中添加一个元素。因此，对于一个两端有可见端点、中间带有标签的连接，jsPlumb 会在 DOM 中添加四个元素。",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_115cceec3e0e_part0": "为了帮助您正确设置 z-index，jsPlumb 会为其添加的每种元素添加一个 CSS 类。具体如下：",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_db14ec37fee9_part0": "组件",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_27276bce84ec_part0": "班级",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_12e78a7bcbdb_part0": "端点",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_2da58260ed6a_part0": "jtk-endpoint",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_ca41e003a8d1_part0": "连接器",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_6fc6e63422f9_part0": "jtk-connector",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_6b58d7b51c1a_part0": "叠加层",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_fdcd43abb363_part0": "jtk-overlay",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_53a7c13d46aa_part0": "此外，每当鼠标悬停在某个端点或连接上时，该组件会被赋予类",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_814d5ab1d990_part0": "jtk-hover",
  "docs/6.x/index.html_e271fb9a6352_part0": ". 有关使用 CSS 设置 jsPlumb 样式的更多信息，请参阅",
